    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“You know where to hit a machine so it hits itself.”</em></p><p>As a <strong>bonus action</strong>, you can target one <strong>construct</strong> or machine-like creature you can see within <strong>6 squares</strong>.</p><ul><li>The target must succeed on a <strong>Body check</strong> (DC = 8 + your tier + your Mind or Soul modifier; choose when you gain this feature) or suffer internal backlash.</li><li>On a failure, the target has <strong>disadvantage</strong> on the next attack roll it makes before the end of its next turn.</li><li>You can use this feature a number of times equal to your <strong>tier</strong>, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Soma Break.</li></ul>",
